<title>SWITZERLAND: Tietmeyer sees appropriate mkt reaction to plan.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer sees appropriate mkt reaction to plan.</headline>
<dateline>INTERLAKEN, Switzerland 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said on Wednesday that he was sure financial markets would react &quot;appropriately&quot; to the issue of the Bundesbank's reserves revaluation.</p>
<p>Tietmeyer also said he was interested in the mark remaining strong in future.</p>
<p>&quot;I am pretty sure the markets will assess this and react in an appropriate way,&quot; Tietmeyer told reporters at a news conference.</p>
<p>He also said: &quot;We are interested in a strong mark in future too.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
